{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"滴り日奈子見てくれたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！89回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nすみれさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/31/3630493/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は予定が変わり、\n予定よりも2時間はやく家に帰れたので\nお母さんとチップとお散歩に行きました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日あったある話しをお母さんにしてたら、\n大笑いしちゃって、\nお散歩一時中断でした！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学の時のテストの話だったんだけどね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんには内緒です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、インサイド・ヘッドみたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビンボン可愛すぎる！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビンボンが消えちゃった時\nすごく泣いた。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニー映画って大人になっても\n心に響くものがあるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インサイド・ヘッドもいろいろ考えました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感情のお話だし\n頭の中の思い出の話とか\n忘れることとか、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビンボンも、またいつか\nライリーに思い出してもらえたらいいな！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢の中でも空想でも\nビンボンとライリーがまた会えたらいいな！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、本当に\n頭のヨロコビやカナシミみたいに\nあのみんながいたとしたら\n面白いな～！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怒ってる時も、イカリを思い出したら\n怒るのやめそう！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画見るのまたはまりそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本も読みたいな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/31/3630493/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BUBKAさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日発売です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/31/3630493/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショット！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/31/3630493/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/31/3630493/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  たかまさ@エンジユニさん■ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":